      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cape_Charles%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Cape Charles hosts one of the largest concentrations of turn‑of‑the‑century buildings on the East Coast, many listed on the National Register.",
